    <br><br>
    <div class="services" id="service">
        <div class="text-wrap-1">
            <p class="text-1">Our <b class="bold-text-1">Services</b></p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-wrap">
            <p class="text">Our freelancing platform offers a comprehensive suite of services designed to connect
                businesses with skilled professionals</p>
        </div>

        <div class="images">
            <div class="image-1">
                <div class="image-1.1">
                    <h2 class="img-title-1 img-title">Video Editor</h2>
                    <img src="images/peter-stumpf-Q2-OEzSZY94-unsplash.jpg" alt="img-1" class="img img-1">
                </div>

                <div class="image-1.2">
                    <h2 class="img-title-2 img-title">Data Analyst</h2>
                    <img src="images/choong-deng-xiang--WXQm_NTK0U-unsplash.jpg" alt="img-2" class="img img-2">
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="image-2">
                <div class="image2.1">
                    <h2 class="img-title-3 img-title">Graphic Designer</h2>
                    <img src="images/7176410_3572691.jpg" alt="img-3" class="img img-3">
                </div>

                <div class="image-2.2">
                    <h2 class="img-title-4 img-title">Web Developer</h2>
                    <img src="images/turned-gray-laptop-computer.jpg" alt="img-4" class="img img-4">
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>

        <div class="button-1">
            <button class="btn">Explore All</button>
        </div>
        <br>

    </div>

    <div class="features" id="feature">
        <div class="text-wrap-1">
            <p class="text-1">Our <b class="bold-text-1">Features</b></p>
        </div>

        <div class="text-wrap">
            <p class="text">Our freelancing platform offers a variety of features designed to enhance the experience for
                both businesses and freelancers </p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-containers">
            <div class="card" style="width: 18rem;">
                <img src="images/images_job_tracking.png" class="card-img-top" alt="...">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h5 class="card-title">Job Tracking</h5>
                    <p class="card-text">Our platform offers robust job tracking features to help businesses and
                        freelancers stay organized and informed throughout the project lifecycle</p>
                    <a href="/" class="btn btn-primary">Read more</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card" style="width: 18rem;">
                <img src="images/collaboration.jpg" class="card-img-top" alt="...">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h5 class="card-title">collaboration</h5>
                    <p class="card-text">Our platform offers to foster collaboration between Clients/Businesses and
                        Freelancers.</p>
                    <a href="/" class="btn btn-primary">Read more</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card" style="width: 18rem;">
                <img src="images/certificate.jpg" class="card-img-top" alt="...">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h5 class="card-title">certifications</h5>
                    <p class="card-text">Our paltform offers certification to help freelancers showcase their skills and
                        credibility to potentil clients. </p>
                    <a href="/" class="btn btn-primary">Read more</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card" style="width: 18rem;">
                <img src="images/user_friendly.jpg" class="card-img-top" alt="...">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h5 class="card-title">User Friendly</h5>
                    <p class="card-text">Our platform is designed with user-friendly in mind, offering a range of
                        features to make it easy for both businesses and freelancers</p>
                    <a href="/" class="btn btn-primary">Read more</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card" style="width: 18rem;">
                <img src="images/escrow_payment.jpg" class="card-img-top" alt="...">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h5 class="card-title">Secure Payments</h5>
                    <p class="card-text">Our platform utilizes an escrow payment system to ensure secure and reliable
                        transactions between businesses and freelancers.</p>
                    <a href="/" class="btn btn-primary">Read more</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

